    "updated_at": "2023-07-12T04:41:59Z",
    "body": "i think WebKit shows a comma because it uses `Number.prototype.toLocaleString` for `%i`/`%d`/`%f`\r\n\r\nseems reasonable to just remove that (not to mention `console.log(\"1000\")` should probably have the same output as `console.log(\"%i\", 1000)`)",
